algorithms.pseudocode:
Algorithm: SteepestExchangeDescent(S, f, x0)
Input: Exchange family S in Z^d, objective f: S -> Z, start x0 in S
Output: Local (global under DLC) minimum x*

x <- x0
while True:
    best <- x
    for each exchange neighbor y of x in S:
        if f(y) < f(best):
            best <- y
    if best = x:
        return x    // locally optimal
    x <- best

Complexity: O(d^2 * d^(d-k) * D) under depth-k certificate.
